                        "$(x + y)^2 = x^2 + y^2 + 2xy \\implies 13^2 = 97 + 2xy \\implies 169 = 97 + 2xy \\implies 2xy = 72 \\implies xy = 36$.",
                        "Equation: $t^2 - 13t + 36 = 0 \\implies (t - 4)(t - 9) = 0 \\implies t = 4, 9$."
